          "short": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11-3\\sqrt{13}}2\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{11+3\\sqrt{13}}2\\right)$\n\nComplete the square, then use the difference of two squares.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-11x+1&=\\left(x^2-11x+\\frac{121}{4}\\right)-\\frac{121}{4}+1\\\\x^2-11x+1&=\\left(x-\\frac{11}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{117}{4}\\\\x^2-11x+1&=\\left(x-\\frac{11}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{3\\sqrt{13}}2\\right)^2\\\\x^2-11x+1&=\\left(x-\\frac{11-3\\sqrt{13}}2\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{11+3\\sqrt{13}}2\\right)\\end{align*}$$",
